ror_code":"no_reviews"},{"game_id":"steam-5119140","metric":"demo_ccu","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:26:41Z","value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=5214840","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-5119140-1846651706695865","game_id":"steam-5119140","kind":"announcement","title":"Midnight Rogues Next Fest Demo Gameplay","summary":"Midnight Rogues is taking part in Steam Next Fest, and our big demo update is live!Watch gameplay from the updated demo and see how it works: buy items, arrange them on your board, and watch a timer activate them in sequence. Changing the order can turn the same collection of items into a much stronger build. Bigger items occupy more slots and activate more times!This broadcast features prerecorded gameplay with in-game audio and no commentary.Want to try your own combinations? Play the free dem","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T16:02:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706695865","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:47:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5119140-1846651706690888","game_id":"steam-5119140","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch Notes - v0.3","summary":"Hey everyone!The first major update of Midnight Rogues is here. This update brings a complete UI overhaul, encounter balances in the later acts, and a round of balance changes for Roughcut. You'll also find new models for some enemies, better atmosphere in boss encounters, and clearer feedback when arranging items and managing your backpack. Here are the highlights since build 0.2!Without further ado, let’s dive in:USER INTERFACE & EXPERIENCE:Overhauled the UI across the main menu, character sel","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T15:53:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690888","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:47:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5119140-1846651706689621","game_id":"steam-5119140","kind":"announcement","title":"Midnight Rogues Is Coming to Steam Next Fest!","summary":"Hey everyone,We’re excited to share that Midnight Rogues is taking part in Steam Next Fest, October 19 to 26!The free demo is already available, and we have a big demo update on the way. We can’t wait for you to try it and hear what you think!If you’re discovering Midnight Rogues for the first time, it’s a roguelike auto-battler where you buy items and carefully arrange them on a board:Build your sequence: Buy and arrange cards on a board, then watch a timer move through your cards and activate ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T10:31:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706689621","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:47:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5119140-1846651706685526","game_id":"steam-5119140","kind":"announcement","title":"Midnight Rogues Launches On November 3!","summary":"We’re so excited to share some big news with you: Midnight Rogues is launching on Steam on November 3!We can’t wait for you to experience the full game and save The City from these corrupt superheroes.We also have more news to share with you. We are taking part in October Next Fest, and we have a major demo update coming up with a new UI, new enemies, new sound effects, and more. We are working tirelessly on this update to get it live by Next Fest, and you can see a glimpse of it in this trailer","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T20:10:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706685526","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:47:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5119140-1845383656379264","game_id":"steam-5119140","kind":"announcement","title":"Play the Midnight Rogues Demo Now!","summary":"We’re very excited to share that the Midnight Rogues demo is now available! You’ll have access to all the content for the first character, giving you a taste of what’s to come in the full game. We’re eager to hear your feedback and use it to make the final game as good as possible.We’re also revealing the full game’s price: Midnight Rogues will launch on Steam at $6.99 USD, with regional pricing and a launch discount.Try the free demo today, and wishlist the full game if you’d like to play more!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-01T00:06:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656379264","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:47:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5119140-1844751498218263","game_id":"steam-5119140","kind":"announcement","title":"Midnight Rogues Demo Page Is Live | Play September 30","summary":"Our first public Midnight Rogues demo arrives on September 30! Its separate Steam page is live now, so you can take a look before the demo becomes playable.Midnight Rogues is a roguelike auto-battler where you collect items and arrange them across a tableau. When combat begins, a timer activates them in sequence. Change their placement or activation order, and the same items can create a very different combination.We’re looking forward to seeing the sequences you build when the demo goes live.Vi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-23T12:12:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498218263","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:47:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_n